Manages code push releases

Usage: leptoskit codepush <COMMAND>

Commands:
  release  Packs a directory into a versioned release signed with the publisher key
  keygen   Creates a publisher signing key and prints its public key for `codepush.public_keys`
  publish  Uploads a channel's releases to an S3-compatible bucket (Backblaze B2, Cloudflare R2, AWS S3), so a CDN can serve updates with no server
  pull     Copies a channel's newest release from an S3-compatible bucket into the store, verified against `codepush.public_keys`, so `release` can number the next build and delta from it on a runner that starts empty
  serve    Serves a release store for clients to update from, on the configured `serve.address`
  check    Checks for updates against a store, like a client would
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
